knowledge-base/reference/rearch/43_brp_entry_plan.md:48:> - **AIMS (canonical schedule + actuals/estimates):** the legacy day-planner `FlightTimeline.tsx` is fed by `aimsLegtimesQuery.ts` = **LEGMAIN (STD/STA, ADLY, CANCELLED) ⋈ LEGTIMES (ETD/ETA, TKOF/BLOF/TDOWN/BLON)** joined on `(DAY,CARRIER,FLT,DEP,LEGCD)`, CM-only, not-cancelled. Times = UTC minutes-of-day from the AIMS day epoch. `deriveStatus`: BLON|TDOWN→landed, TKOF→airborne, BLOF→departed, else scheduled (legacy gates on "within 15 PTY-min of now"; our plane treats any recorded actual as terminal — a faithful simplification). Delay (timeline-displayed) = **estimated − scheduled** (`computeDelayMins(STD,ETD)` / `(STA,ETA)`), overnight-wrapped. Airborne envelope = TKOF recorded ∧ before first landing actual ∧ before ETA+30min buffer.
